<!-- INTRO -->
<div class="intro-strip">
  <p>At Melia Nae Jewellers, we believe in helping you choose the perfect diamond. The 4 Cs — Cut, Clarity, Colour, and Carat — are the key factors that determine a diamond's beauty, brilliance, and value.</p>
